# grey prose/en/wire/blob · signer lane-A is not admitted
bound-lock/1 about="A world travels as a blob: capsule.bound and its build, split as ES modules, one region per file — dist/index.js the entry, dist/regions/<name>.js each region the lock names — packed as one tar, gzipped and named by the {hash} digest of its bytes. The entry names only where the world lies; the host is handed the lock already parsed and loads each region from its own file by its name and its role." at=witness:a-host-that-loaded-worlds-with-a-second-loader by=lane-A epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/wire/blob sig="ed25519:era1:1H2rVBf9hYLH87akSCqSJTRyQ67/QLWnyojnJx2dWkvQEt7YGlg2Vmc1c0ruweC0pj5zDWSAS6dhv06E1R6sBA==" value=lock
