# grey prose/en/wire/header · signer lane-A is not admitted
bound-lock/1 about="A line begins with its header, {header}: the name of the protocol, a slash and its version. A line without a header is refused. A version this reader does not know is held, not refused, because it is the future arriving." at=policy:wire-page by=lane-A epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/wire/header sig="ed25519:era1:S7HFAXtQ1uZmi6MfrlMVkWpV3TUVJpvYOnCEYbUBg9EJh6Y0ZEPBce66zXCW7J6PIC6FgZh5VPm4Oyy7suafBA==" value=lock
