# grey prose/en/wire/quoting · signer lane-A is not admitted
bound-lock/1 about="A value that holds a space, an equals sign, a double quote, a backslash or a newline is written in double quotes. Inside them `\\\"` is a quote, `\\\\` a backslash and `\\n` a newline, and any other escape is refused. A value that needs no quotes never gets them." at=policy:wire-page by=lane-A epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/wire/quoting sig="ed25519:era1:g/9qgchnZmDvfXL+HrSCxXK+cyFYBxjS727Qx6tAAD7yIrt38cs8S7Ec7Vj4odt59Jgb6E1R+rGvQCeeDQUyCw==" value=lock
# grey prose/en/wire/quoting/heading · signer lane-A is not admitted
